{"help": "https://open.canada.ca/data/api/3/action/help_show?name=package_search", "success": true, "result": {"count": 13, "facets": {}, "facet_ranges": {"portal_release_date": {"counts": ["1926-11-08T00:00:00Z", 9], "gap": "+100YEARS", "start": "1926-11-08T00:00:00Z", "end": "2126-11-08T00:00:00Z"}}, "facet_queries": {}, "results": [{"association_type": [], "audience": [], "author": null, "author_email": "[email withheld by Lighthouse]", "collection": "geogratis", "contributor": {}, "creator_user_id": "aa584ab4-544c-4c5c-81da-d1cff9bd96fa", "data_series_issue_identification": {"fr": "No. 23", "en": "No. 23"}, "data_series_name": {"fr": "Atlas du Canada, 1e \u00e9dition", "en": "Atlas of Canada, 1st Edition"}, "date_published": "1906-06-30 00:00:00", "digital_object_identifier": "", "display_flags": [], "frequency": "as_needed", "geographic_region": [], "id": "8253e300-31a2-5d0e-8911-3bf38edca2e4", "imso_approval": "true", "isopen": false, "jurisdiction": "federal", "keywords": {"fr": ["embarcation", "industrie du transport maritime", "installations maritimes", "navigation", "navire", "phare", "transport maritime", "voie navigable"], "en": ["lighthouses", "marine installations", "navigation", "ships", "vessels", "water transport", "water transport industry", "waterways"]}, "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "license_title": "Open Government Licence - Canada", "license_url": "https://open.canada.ca/en/open-government-licence-canada", "maintainer": null, "maintainer_contact_form": {}, "maintainer_email": "[email withheld by Lighthouse]", "metadata_contact": {}, "metadata_created": "2016-09-24T21:28:25.341029", "metadata_modified": "2022-03-14T19:52:43.187382", "name": "8253e300-31a2-5d0e-8911-3bf38edca2e4", "notes": "Contained within the 1st Edition (1906) of the Atlas of Canada is a map that shows the lighthouses, as well as sailing routes along the Pacific Coast, circa 1906. There are routes that sailing distances are given from the principal ocean ports of Canada to the other great ocean ports of the world. A table gives the distance, in miles, to Vancouver and Victoria from other major ports. The lighthouses are distinguished between fixed and revolving lights, and light ships. The depth of the water along the coast line is indicated by contours and tints of blue. The deeper portions are shown in the darker tints, while lighter tints indicate shallow waters.", "notes_translated": {"fr": "La premi\u00e8re \u00e9dition de l'Atlas du Canada (1906) comprend une carte qui repr\u00e9sente les phares et les routes de navigation sur la c\u00f4te du Pacifique en 1906. Les distances des routes des ports du Canada vers les ports d'autres oc\u00e9ans dans le monde sont fournies. Un tableau indique les distances (en milles) de Vancouver et de Victoria vers d'autres ports importants. Les phares sont divis\u00e9s en trois cat\u00e9gories; fixes, rotatifs et bateaux-phares. La profondeur des eaux des Grands Lacs est indiqu\u00e9e par les courbes de niveau et les teintes de bleu. Les parties les plus profondes sont d'un bleu plus fonc\u00e9 tandis que les parties les moins profondes d'un bleu plus clair.", "en": "Contained within the 1st Edition (1906) of the Atlas of Canada is a map that shows the lighthouses, as well as sailing routes along the Pacific Coast, circa 1906. There are routes that sailing distances are given from the principal ocean ports of Canada to the other great ocean ports of the world. A table gives the distance, in miles, to Vancouver and Victoria from other major ports. The lighthouses are distinguished between fixed and revolving lights, and light ships. The depth of the water along the coast line is indicated by contours and tints of blue. The deeper portions are shown in the darker tints, while lighter tints indicate shallow waters."}, "num_resources": 2, "num_tags": 0, "org_section": {}, "org_title_at_publication": {"fr": "Ressources naturelles Canada", "en": "Natural Resources Canada"}, "organization": {"id": "9391E0A2-9717-4755-B548-4499C21F917B", "name": "nrcan-rncan", "title": "Natural Resources Canada | Ressources naturelles Canada", "type": "organization", "description": "", "image_url": "", "created": "2016-09-23T17:25:46.737130", "is_organization": true, "approval_status": "approved", "state": "active"}, "owner_org": "9391E0A2-9717-4755-B548-4499C21F917B", "place_of_publication": [], "portal_release_date": "2017-01-18", "position_name": {}, "presentation_form": "map_hardcopy", "private": false, "program_page_url": {}, "ready_to_publish": "true", "restrictions": "unrestricted", "spatial": "{\"type\": \"Polygon\", \"coordinates\": [[[-134.0, 55.3], [-134.0, 47.8], [-116.0, 47.8], [-116.0, 55.3], [-134.0, 55.3]]]}", "spatial_representation_type": [], "state": "active", "subject": ["economics_and_industry", "government_and_politics", "nature_and_environment", "transport"], "title": "Lighthouses and Sailing Routes, Pacific Coast", "title_translated": {"fr": "Phares et routes de navigation de la c\u00f4te du Pacifique", "en": "Lighthouses and Sailing Routes, Pacific Coast"}, "topic_category": ["boundaries", "inland_waters", "oceans", "structure", "transport"], "type": "dataset", "url": "{u'fr': u'http://geogratis.gc.ca/api/fr/nrcan-rncan/ess-sst/8253e300-31a2-5d0e-8911-3bf38edca2e4', u'en': u'http://geogratis.gc.ca/api/en/nrcan-rncan/ess-sst/8253e300-31a2-5d0e-8911-3bf38edca2e4'}", "version": null, "resources": [{"cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2017-01-26T16:47:55.970001", "data_quality": [], "datastore_active": false, "description": "", "format": "JPG", "hash": "", "id": "60e73191-4f24-46f6-9ed2-4c42e76c415f", "language": ["en", "fr"], "last_modified": null, "metadata_modified": "2017-01-26T16:47:55.970001", "mimetype": null, "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "Download JPG through HTTP", "name_translated": {"fr": "T\u00e9l\u00e9charger le fichier en format JPG via HTTP", "en": "Download JPG through HTTP"}, "package_id": "8253e300-31a2-5d0e-8911-3bf38edca